    title: "Iran’s chief negotiator tells Al Jazeera ‘ball in US court’",
    summary: "Iran’s chief negotiator says it’s up to the US to answer Iran’s position in the latest round of peace talks.",
    preview: "Iran’s chief negotiator says it’s up to the US to answer Iran’s position in the latest round of peace talks. In an exclusive interview with Al Jazeera, Mohammad Bagher Ghalibaf said the US must accept the limits of its own legal rights in the region and move on.",
